; bal -V --unrealized books no unrealized gain for a lot bought and sold in
; different periods when the report groups postings by period, weekday or
; payee.  Such a report passes on each account's subtotal for the group,
; which carries no cost, so it keeps the revaluation between postings
; instead of valuing each posting at its cost.  Valuing the subtotals on
; their own dates would count the $1,000.00 gain realized by the sale a
; second time, as an unrealized gain.  The journal is that of 1821_2.test.
; The --by-payee report prints nothing, as bal --by-payee does on this
; journal; a baseline built from its subtotals printed "$-1,000.00
; Equity:Unrealized Gains".
;
; Under --dc, which does not group postings, each column is revalued
; against its own cost.  The 50 AAPL bought, in the debit column, and the
; 50 AAPL sold, in the credit column, are each valued at $2,500.00 against
; the $1,500.00 they cost, so Equity:Unrealized Gains is zero net: it holds
; $-1,000.00 in the debit column and $1,000.00 in the credit column, which
; the report prints as absolute values, so the debit column as printed does
; not add up to its total.  Both columns total $4,000.00.

2004-05-01 Stock purchase
    Assets:Broker                   50 AAPL @ $30.00
    Assets:Broker                   $-1,500

2005-08-01 Stock sale
    Assets:Broker                   -50 AAPL {$30} @ $50.00
    Income:Capital Gains            $-1,000.00
    Assets:Broker                   $2,500

test bal -V --unrealized -M
           $1,000.00  Assets:Broker
          $-1,000.00  Income:Capital Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --dow
           $1,000.00  Assets:Broker
          $-1,000.00  Income:Capital Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --by-payee
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --dc
     $5,000.00      $4,000.00      $1,000.00  Assets:Broker
     $1,000.00      $1,000.00              0  Equity:Unrealized Gains
             0      $1,000.00     $-1,000.00  Income:Capital Gains
-------------- -------------- --------------
     $4,000.00      $4,000.00              0
end test
